{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>你手機裡是不是裝了五、六個不同的謎題 App，卻還是覺得不夠過癮？《Word &amp; Logic》把所有文字遊戲、邏輯謎題與大腦訓練濃縮在一個應用程式裡，今天正限時免費中。無論你只有零碎的五分鐘，還是想認真燒腦一小時，這款多合一謎題中心都能滿足你，從尋字、填字、數獨到密碼破解，種類多到永遠不會膩。</p>\n\n<h2>一包囊括十大燒腦玩法</h2>\n<p>內建尋字、填字、數獨、密碼破解、單詞分類、井字拼詞、單詞猜測、最佳前 6 以及魔幻六邊形等十種經典模式，總關卡數超過 10,000 關。支援 15 種以上語言與深色模式，每天還有免費每日挑戰，讓你一邊保持連續通關紀錄，一邊不知不覺提升詞彙量與邏輯力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-10-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-11-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Word &amp; Logic: 迷你益智遊戲</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T14:24:45.013421+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}